"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"lOipP8dh4Daqid9uro4xNA","review_id":"SjKwie_yEWBYxSSxrKhXRg","date":"2018-01-18T04:19:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9370685815811157,"text_excerpt":"This place is not cheap, the ice cream is like 8 dollars, for vegans at least. But that is my only complaint. This place is awesome for the occasional treat. Rolled ice cream is so unique and this is one out of two places to get it in the New Orleans area. This place is beautiful in the inside and out, they have an endless list of flavors, nice staff, and it is delicious! Plus, this is the only place I know of to get TACO ICE CREAM! ah it was an experience! Plus you get unlimited toppings, but Sadly a lot don't fit in the cup. Still great place and I hope to come back sometime soon! Ps. People keep complaining about the weight times, wel I've been twice and I went at like 2 pm and there w..."},{"business_id":"lOipP8dh4Daqid9uro4xNA","review_id":"nDHOesFcyTOCtVDMpJFLoA","date":"2017-07-29T00:23:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9364054799079895,"text_excerpt":"The Bywater is the perfect spot for this new ice cream/snow ball joint. First, not a lot of competition. Second. Bywater folks can appreciate the \"craft\" of this place. By craft I mean slow... and fun and tasty. They have 10 premade flavor combos. The combos are the typical flavor profiles, strawberry, cookies and cream, sea salt carmel, etc. I had the smore and my friend the cookie monster. I think some ofvthe complaints about time can be resolved by having signage or a staff person ask is this your first time and if so explain the process. Or maybe some signage like \"start here\". But I will do my best to help now. So first you order and pay. We were there midday on a weekday so the flow..."},{"business_id":"lOipP8dh4Daqid9uro4xNA","review_id":"bhCW4C9TIohObYowH5y_3w","date":"2019-04-18T21:14:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9299479722976685,"text_excerpt":"This place is cool. Took my daughter here. There was a line. Only two people working when we went. That was a little aggravating, but once we got up front to order, it was worth it. The ice cream is flavorful. There's a lot to order on the menu. I'd recommend it. Cool place to take the kids and sit, just be prepared to stand in line on busy weekends."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"lOipP8dh4Daqid9uro4xNA","photo_id":"UrStYolMtGy6loDry_-bpw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/UrStYolMtGy6loDry_-bpw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9789915084838867},{"business_id":"lOipP8dh4Daqid9uro4xNA","photo_id":"-6vfgrDEGz4yOekd5vHsWg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-6vfgrDEGz4yOekd5vHsWg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9755055904388428},{"business_id":"lOipP8dh4Daqid9uro4xNA","photo_id":"A_XqweRfm86ESWt1Bvc5pQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/A_XqweRfm86ESWt1Bvc5pQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.956207811832428},{"business_id":"lOipP8dh4Daqid9uro4xNA","photo_id":"6SQt9A4uuO9Sdal9w5t4cA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6SQt9A4uuO9Sdal9w5t4cA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9433917999267578},{"business_id":"lOipP8dh4Daqid9uro4xNA","photo_id":"OWL5KIdM0GjFBw-0-XWrAw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/OWL5KIdM0GjFBw-0-XWrAw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9081707000732422}]},"notebook_case":null}
